{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n有冇啲群組約親食飯都冇人覆！？你以為大家係太忙未睇訊息？錯喇！其實背後藏住心理學嘅「責任分散」效應， @minnie_yuenting  話你知！\n</p>\n<p>群組人數越多，每個人就越容易覺得：「唔急啦，總會有人先覆嘅～」結果久而久之就冇人覆message了～</p>\n<p>只要冇人跨出第一步，大家就會玩心理戰「敵不動我不動」，睇下邊個肯覆message先！</p>\n<p>要破解呢個困局其實好簡單，只要有一個勇者率先提出特定時間，呢種尷尬嘅沉默就會瞬間瓦解，其他人自然就會跟住覆！</p>\n<p>如果大家身邊有一個永遠都會秒覆嘅朋友group，一定要好好珍惜啊！</p>\n<p>快啲 share俾個班成日唔覆機嘅朋友啦</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937936483495148_16630190846aeb1e70a36fa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937936483495148_16630190846aeb1e70a36fa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部、AI生成影片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfUMY7rFBXM/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:25:52.513834+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:00:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:38:49.078408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:18:39.761737+00:00","content_hash":"096243da669bad90e3a2bbf7330872ceca46b08f21bad31282e1732748b3e117","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}